"  ┌ Network configuration wizard ────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  "
"  │ Step 1 of 5: Passive and active mode                                         │  "
"  │                                                                              │  "
"  │ FTP opens a second connection for every listing and transfer. In passive     │  "
"  │ mode your computer opens it to the server: this works through most routers   │  "
"  │ and firewalls and is the default. In active mode the server connects back to │  "
"  │ your computer, so incoming connections must reach you; behind a router that  │  "
"  │ means forwarding ports.                                                      │  "
"  │                                                                              │  "
"  │ This wizard sets up both modes and tests them against a server you choose.   │  "
"  │                                                                              │  "
